S_c=S^{\\rm SI}\\circ\\Phi_c$, with $S^{\\rm SI}$ supplied by the Gibbs assignments through this inverse. Thus the displayed derivatives are derivatives in physical SI coordinates on $\\Phi_c(O_c)$; the model patch is not an empirical claim about an independently specified material domain.",
