      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "Write $w_0=P(\\{0\\})$ and $w_1=P(\\{1\\})$. By [F2], $w_0+w_1=1$ and the barycenter equation is $w_1=\\tfrac12$. Hence the only feasible measure is $P_*=\\tfrac12\\delta_0+\\tfrac12\\delta_1$.",
